    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Story</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows a young man in the Skull mountains as he tries to figure out the mysteries behind the supposedly cursed lake. But as he explores more and more, he gets stuck in time when the midnight hits with no other chance of escape than going deep into the lake.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's hunted by undead monsters, mutants and bizarre creatures all made from the strange moss that corrupts the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FPS horror game with a PSX style, you can make your own choices that changes the story of the game. You solve puzzles, escape from creatures, look for objects and explore your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/0553dd75d465e3edbc51b1bb07ef2e14.avif?t=1751579765\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fate</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can have a drastic influence on the story of the game and sometimes may even be... fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Danger</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangers in these mountains can be <strong>deadly</strong> and unpredictable id you don't pay attention to your surroundings. You can never be sure if you are <strong>safe</strong>... because <strong>they</strong> are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/04472b1db3571bc99ea1f190167fcae5.avif?t=1751579765\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Story</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows a young man in the Skull mountains as he tries to figure out the mysteries behind the supposedly cursed lake. But as he explores more and more, he gets stuck in time when the midnight hits with no other chance of escape than going deep into the lake.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's hunted by undead monsters, mutants and bizarre creatures all made from the strange moss that corrupts the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FPS horror game with a PSX style, you can make your own choices that changes the story of the game. You solve puzzles, escape from creatures, look for objects and explore your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/0553dd75d465e3edbc51b1bb07ef2e14.avif?t=1751579765\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fate</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can have a drastic influence on the story of the game and sometimes may even be... fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Danger</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangers in these mountains can be <strong>deadly</strong> and unpredictable id you don't pay attention to your surroundings. You can never be sure if you are <strong>safe</strong>... because <strong>they</strong> are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/04472b1db3571bc99ea1f190167fcae5.avif?t=1751579765\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
